<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on Sime Darby.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Sime Darby.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it intended to issue 100 million American-style call warrants on shares of Sime Darby Bhd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	MYR 7.0125    PREMIUM	 9.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 MYR 0.205     GEARING	 4.02X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.DEC.97     PAYDATE	 09.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    MYR 8.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
